0	"# Handwritten Digit Classification using a Dense Neural Network\n"
1	"\n"
2	"This notebook demonstrates the implementation of a Multi-Layer Perceptron (MLP) / Multi-Layer Dense Neural Network built with **TensorFlow / Keras** to classify $8 \\times 8$ pixel grayscale images of handwritten digits from the `scikit-learn` digits dataset."
1	
cell_type	"markdown"
id	"a4f19ca3"
metadata	{}
source	
0	"## 1. Environment and Dependencies Setup\n"
1	"\n"
2	"We import essential libraries for numerical computation, matrix manipulation, data loading, visualization, and deep learning model building."
2	
