source	
0	"## 2. Dataset Loading and Inspection\n"
1	"\n"
2	"The Optical Recognition of Handwritten Digits dataset consists of $1,797$ 8x8 pixel images. Each image represents a digit from 0 to 9, where pixel intensity values range from 0 to 16."
