0	"## 3. Data Preprocessing and Partitioning\n"
1	"\n"
2	"We split the dataset into training ($80\\%$) and testing ($20\\%$) subsets. Feature scaling is applied by dividing pixel values by $16.0$ to normalize inputs into the interval $[0, 1]$, improving numerical stability during gradient descent updates."
