0	"## 6. Model Compilation and Optimization Setup\n"
1	"\n"
2	"The model is compiled using **Stochastic Gradient Descent (SGD)** with a learning rate $\\eta = 0.01$. The loss function selected is **Sparse Categorical Cross-Entropy**, suitable for multi-class classification with integer target labels."
